      "html": "<ul class=\"d2u-list\"><li><strong>Cinematography</strong><br>Camera operation, lenses, exposure, and lighting for narrative and doc.</li><li><strong>Directing</strong><br>Working with performers and crew, blocking, and shot design.</li><li><strong>Screenwriting</strong><br>Story structure, scene work, and production-ready scripts.</li><li><strong>Editing & Post</strong><br>Premiere Pro / DaVinci workflows, color, sound, and delivery.</li><li><strong>On-Set Experience</strong><br>Hands-on time on real Digi2U productions and client shoots.</li></ul>"
